WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.290
Put the light words to work today.

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:05.510
Then try book words you have never studied.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:10.500
Break each one into its parts, and work out the meaning before anyone tells you.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.930
Then four new lanterns.
